  "body": "Make STR8N-F the focused boot/recovery product with an operator ZIP and a separate complete source ZIP. The kit supplies the exact existing b15 F, CONFIG/OPAQUE/DEMO/READBACK RAM tools, optional BASE monitors, explicit component destinations, packet preparation and a quick start. Optional full-system components remain in the source package; the future SPI WORK journal and factory migration are outside the release.\n\nFirmware bytes and the SNBT contract are unchanged. Preserve the b15/PR04/8000000F identity and document the USB hardware evidence and raw-loader limits. CI defaults to archive/source integrity; CPU models are manual opt-in.\n\nValidation: 19 operator-kit files and 143 public source files checked after extraction; all committed public blobs match the source ZIP; payload hashes match their existing baselines. No assembly build, CPU-model rerun, board flashing or 2205 modification was performed. Private owner/WDC/SRAM/RTC captures are excluded.",
